    "why": [
      "The two conditions were satisfied by DIFFERENT ARMS. 'Above zero' came from last_patch (+0.0042); the lift came from concat_strikes, whose matched-width lift runs from -0.0813 to -0.0555, both NEGATIVE R^2, so neither of those two arms predicts the residual better than its own mean.",
